{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"9380","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v18098","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170699","characterName":"レザン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170699"},"originalCharacterName":"レザン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Apparently, he is a wandering warrior traveling through various lands to hone his martial arts skills. He gets caught up in an incident at the Youd Magic Academy, which he had visited in order to become a magic swordsman. He is cheesy, perverted, overconfident, and frivolous. When it comes to women, he is completely soft and indulgent."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170699"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94bded65f683cc290376802887bcf33cfacabac98205f2361335c403d7c02d4e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/233b4fba91c07010d815e78d98596638b69d905e6c1a3560a1f2bfa6cce6490a.webp","width":147,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170700","characterName":"ジーナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170700"},"originalCharacterName":"ジーナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her personality is lively and proactive. She can also feel a bit too simplistic at times. She serves as a leader figure among the apprentice mages at the Youd Magic Academy. Although she acts tough on the outside, deep down she has a desire to be pampered by a reliable man. She prefers flashy and offensive magic."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170700"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35698d0cf9241497ae6dd59c55b55944eac6da2c290198e7c1c7a9724f55c4ea.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e52e518b505c3e441de458a1c0a19c7b61347c785d56db99e9e4d9ba24608eb1.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170701","characterName":"ルティー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170701"},"originalCharacterName":"ルティー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is the next oldest after Gina, she is a reserved and quiet girl. She apparently suffers from androphobia (fear of men) and seems to have a slight lesbian streak. While she is modest, she also has a playful side, occasionally chiming in or interrupting other people's conversations out of nowhere. Due to her personality, she specializes in healing magic."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170701"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2bcb317c239cbbdd3aa610e9ebf789b8925e714f5b78d9fcf59c0154c09119f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da9b9624dcbb1afedb2f32e65c13129386e69d0db928115805a15e3a2f398526.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170702","characterName":"ミリアム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170702"},"originalCharacterName":"ミリアム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her age, she has a calm and mature aura. She is intellectual and tries to solve everything logically. She is a clean freak who cannot handle mice or bugs, completely losing her composure at the mere sight of them. In terms of magic, she is capable of mastering offensive spells."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170702"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d39566ae1f4690b23bbbb54dbcf0254dcfbc5a245fdf6dde6601646ea6efc2a9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/458ba23687ac3a1af6f70a1eb4e2d24b31b92dde1c7fc101a65c218b856c3b67.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170703","characterName":"リセリー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170703"},"originalCharacterName":"リセリー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is usually spaced out, she bursts into tears at the slightest provocation. She is a typical \"burikko\" (a girl who acts cutely fake). However, when it comes to romance, she is surprisingly knowledgeable and proactive, even making moves on Rezan herself. In terms of magic, she is responsible for healing spells."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170703"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85c70d337d3783537aa922c634e8354bc1a352a0ed43da43aa590d5af1a5da5d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd595b77dd1df3f978e513b5fb4e5043054e02907a52f627bfa21f277e699ff0.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170704","characterName":"メモリア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170704"},"originalCharacterName":"メモリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"13"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The youngest, most energetic, and innocent girl. Due to her youth, she ends up playing a crucial role in this story. Inside her hat lives her pet, \"Chappy,\" and she frequently ends up causing commotions alongside Miriam. Thankfully, in terms of magic, she is reliable as she is capable of using summoning spells."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170704"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc75abb377c44ce41d2c4dcd7da4d93bd9ecb3e9a01d401a469b0a998b7d1d31.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c918f881422b43abed05e4d71d9b207e834026c9d8638714012f156c30debdd8.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p2380","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2075","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2380","name":"フォーサイト","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-bran